{"id": "EUVD-2026-97376", "enisaUuid": "f2424ada-0c4f-3bcf-8b2a-835982ea0d89", "description": "yshop-crm through 2.1.3 contains a missing authorization vulnerability that allows any authenticated back-office user to approve or reject receivables records by calling POST /admin-api/crm/contract-receivables/check. The handler lacks a @PreAuthorize check and the approver checks in CrmContractReceivablesServiceImpl.check are commented out, so attackers can approve records by id, inflating contract return_money and forging approval logs.", "datePublished": "2026-10-12T13:10:34", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T17:42:10", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/yshop-crm/poc_crm_receivables_check.py", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/controller/admin/crmcontractreceivables/CrmContractReceivablesController.java#L79-L85", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/yshop-module-crm/yshop-module-crm-biz/src/main/java/co/yixiang/yshop/module/crm/service/crmcontractreceivables/CrmContractReceivablesServiceImpl.java#L228-L327", "https://github.com/guchengwuyue/yshop-crm/blob/a77250f7ace63d5b6b363841d9ff441e0e2a9a6b/yshop-crm/sql/yshop-crm-open-source.sql#L2590", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/yshop-crm-through-2.1.3-missing-authorization-via-contract-receivables-check-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-6wf4-4qm3-33w8", "CVE-2026-109172"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.2, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "ae534a1f-e1bb-3a3c-83b7-a3204d05d769", "product": {"name": "yshop-crm", "vendor": {"name": "guchengwuyue"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22642.1.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "8174cfef-90fa-3fa